[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4860117908","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120835#issuecomment-4860117908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120835","id":4860117908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIa-DlA","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T21:17:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T21:31:02Z","body":"This is indeed because of #120418, which fixed #120345. \nIn your case, for example, the `TextureRect` has the horizontal growth direction set to `LEFT` (via `ANCHOR_TOP_RIGHT`) but it would actually grow to the `RIGHT`, which leads to needing workarounds like your script does:\n```gdscript\n\t\tlife1.position.x = -life1.texture.get_size().x * lives\n\t\tlife1.size.x = abs(life1.position.x)\n```\nIf you would like to keep the script unchanged, make it a custom anchor, change the growth direction to `RIGHT`, and keep the workaround. Now that it is fixed, though, your script can change to simply:\n```gdscript\n\t\tlife1.size.x = life1.texture.get_size().x * lives\n```\nYou no longer need to fight the system; it works as one would reasonably expect it to. \n\nRegarding the \"behavior change during patch version\", that's not something I am able to comment on; I am not a maintainer. cc @YeldhamDev  (?)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4860117908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4860205434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120835#issuecomment-4860205434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120835","id":4860205434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIbDZeg","user":{"login":"Usered238","id":30762980,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzYyOTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30762980?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238","html_url":"https://github.com/Usered238","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Usered238/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T21:32:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T21:32:01Z","body":"I agree, it is a good change, however it would be great to keep it for 4.8 only, and mark it as a breaking change.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4860205434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4877441805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120835#issuecomment-4877441805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120835","id":4877441805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIrfbDQ","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:53:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T14:53:53Z","body":"Since the original issue isn't really a regression, and it seems some rely on the faulty behavior, yeah, maybe this shouldn't be cherry-picked.\nCC @Repiteo.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4877441805/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confu